# Events

Standardized events describe what an application observed and how it progressed.
Calling an event method emits a record; it does not perform the operation or
change application state. Definitions come from `catalog/ApplicationEvents/events.json`.

## Event catalog

Select an EventId for its operational documentation. Category links open the
category guide; API links and method names open the generated C# reference.
Deprecated and retired events remain documented for interpreting historical logs.

